  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Debt Management Facility Phase III (DMF III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Debt Management Facility (DMF) aims to reduce debt-related vulnerabilities and improve debt transparency in low and lower middle-income countries&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(246, 247, 250); color: rgb(97, 97, 97);&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;Since 2008, t&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(246, 247, 250); color: rgb(97, 97, 97);&quot;&gt;his Facility implemented by the World Bank (in partnership with the International Monetary Fund) &lt;/span&gt;has been supporting capacity building and reform implementation on debt management in over 80 countries, and has become an internationally recognized global program. DMF in phase III seeks to provide customized advice on sovereign debt management through the design and application of analytical tools, provision of tailored advisory services, and dialogue on debt issues among different stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
